			"start": 3.05,
			"end": 4.472,
			"en": "At the butcher's",
			"zh": "在肉店"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 5.66,
			"end": 9.933,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 11.38,
			"end": 13.886,
			"en": "What does Mr. Bird like?",
			"zh": "伯德先生喜欢什么？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 15.71,
			"end": 19.394,
			"en": "Do you want any meat today, Mrs. Bird?",
			"zh": "伯德夫人，您今天想买些肉吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 20.64,
			"end": 21.909,
			"en": "Yes, please.",
			"zh": "是的，请给我。"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 23.3,
			"end": 26.29,
			"en": "Do you want beef or lamb?",
			"zh": "您想要牛肉还是羊肉？"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 27.05,
			"end": 28.375,
			"en": "Beef, please.",
			"zh": "请给我牛肉。"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 29.77,
			"end": 32.009,
			"en": "This lamb's very good.",
			"zh": "这羊肉很好。"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 33.75,
			"end": 37.386,
			"en": "I like lamb, but my husband doesn't.",
			"zh": "我喜欢羊肉，但我丈夫不喜欢。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 38.62,
			"end": 40.72,
			"en": "What about some steak?",
			"zh": "来点牛排怎么样？"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 41.57,
			"end": 43.864,
			"en": "This is a nice piece.",
			"zh": "这块很好。"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 45,
			"end": 47.461,
			"en": "Give me that piece, please.",
			"zh": "请把那块给我。"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 48.27,
			"end": 51.247,
			"en": "And a pound of mince, too.",
			"zh": "还有一磅肉末。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 52.96,
			"end": 56.476,
			"en": "Do you want a chicken, Mrs. Bird?",
			"zh": "伯德夫人，您要只鸡吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 57.46,
			"end": 59.217,
			"en": "They're very nice.",
			"zh": "这些鸡很好。"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 59.88,
			"end": 61.161,
			"en": "No, thank you.",
			"zh": "不，谢谢。"
		},
		{
			"i": 17,
			"start": 62.23,
			"end": 64.615,
			"en": "My husband likes steak,",
			"zh": "我丈夫喜欢牛排，"
		},
		{
			"i": 18,
			"start": 65.05,
			"end": 67.172,
			"en": "but he doesn't like chicken.",
			"zh": "但他不喜欢鸡肉。"
		},
		{
			"i": 19,
			"start": 68.64,
			"end": 71.908,
			"en": "To tell you the truth, Mrs. Bird,",
			"zh": "说实话，伯德夫人，"
		},
		{
			"i": 20,
			"start": 72.97,
			"end": 74.992,
			"en": "I don't like chicken either!",
			"zh": "我也不喜欢鸡肉！"
		}
	]
}
